<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink191-kilavi">
       varaiviṭaivaittup pirinta talaimakaṉ vantuḻit talaivi muṉintukūṟuvāḷ pōlat taṉ melivu nīṅkiṉamai tōḻikkuc colliyatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
       Spoken by the heroine upon losing her frailty, like one who is angry [with the bangles], when the hero who had separated, [thus] putting a hold on marriage, returned.</p>
  </div> 
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink192">
<l>kōṭupulaṅ koṭpak kaṭaleḻuntu muḻaṅkap</l>
<l>pāṭimiḻ paṉittuṟai yōṭukala mukaikkun</l>
<l>tuṟaivaṉ pirinteṉa nekiḻntaṉa</l>
<l>vīṅkiṉa mātō tōḻiyeṉ vaḷaiyē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>Because the man from the ghat</l>
        <l>- In which moving ships are launched [from] the singing, buzzing, dewy ghat</l>
        <l>As conches revolve in the soil [and] as the sea, having risen, thunders - </l>
        <l>Has separated [from me], </l>
        <l>My bangles have indeed largened, oh friend!</l>
        <l>They [seem to] have slipped down [from my wrist].</l>
              </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
